@overheard pairs
// Writer 4, batch 4. Commons pairs: two named crew talking as you pass, in the room the talk belongs to. Life,
// food, home, hobbies and the shared circles (facts.md 5); at most one in five about work. No couples here.

== overheard
// ---- the mess ----
? place:mess who:madsen-ivo with:walsh-esme
A: Right, listen. So this morning, right...
B: Short version, Ivo.
A: I dropped a spoon.
B: Thank you.   #funny

? place:mess who:varga-tariq with:dlamini-lukas
A: I hope your breakfast finds you well.
B: Hm. It does. Toast.
A: Forty-one onions to thirty-eight, by the way.
B: Not at breakfast, Tariq.   #funny

? place:mess who:larsen-hamid with:grieve-thea
A: You skipped breakfast.
B: You skip breakfast every day.
A: That's how I know it's bad.
B: Pass the toast, then. Two slices.   #funny

? place:mess who:tran-chloe with:santos-zofia
A: Eat something that isn't coffee.
B: Coffee's a bean. Beans are food.
A: That's not how beans work.
B: It's how my beans work.   #funny

? place:mess who:yoon-elif with:janssen-hugo act:breakfast
A: Why did the cup go to bed early? It was tea-red.
B: ...Steady, Elif.
A: Sorry. Sorry. It's the night shift.
B: It's the jokes. But I like them.   #warm

// ---- the bow lounge ----
? place:lounge who:dlamini-lukas with:bakshi-sol
A: Window.
B: No rain.
A: No rain.
B: We could pretend.   #warm

? place:lounge who:ishikawa-orla with:esposito-yara
A: That's a new star. Just there. See it?
B: Three hundred and five. Write it down for me?
A: In your journal or mine?
B: Both. Then we're sure.   #warm

? place:lounge who:takahashi-wen with:haddad-tamsin
A: It's "harbour". Not "harder".
B: Is it? I always sang "harder". Didn't I?
A: Everyone sings it wrong. Except me.
B: And Zeke, and Olu, and...   #funny

? place:lounge who:janssen-hugo|cruz-tove|esposito-yara|walsh-esme|alvarez-luca with:janssen-hugo|cruz-tove|esposito-yara|walsh-esme|alvarez-luca
A: How's your Gerald?
B: Leaning. Thinking, I expect. Yours?
A: New arm.
B: Oh, lovely. Give him my best.   #funny

? place:lounge who:santos-zofia with:strand-erik
A: Rowing board. I'm two seconds off.
B: Off who?
A: Vance. Who's on the treadmill now. Scared.
B: Or just bored of winning.   #funny

// ---- the garden ----
? place:hydroponics_garden who:cruz-tove with:hart-ravi time:morning
A: Mm. Morning.
B: Hate it.
A: The beans like it.
B: ...The beans have a point.   #funny

? place:hydroponics_garden who:oneill-imani with:cruz-tove
A: The garden needs a playlist.
B: Mm. It's got the misters.
A: That's percussion. I'll add a tune.
B: Nothing loud. The lettuces.   #funny

? place:hydroponics_garden who:madsen-ivo with:cruz-tove
A: Can I press one of the marigolds? Just one?
B: Mm. Which one?
A: The one by the bench. It's perfect.
B: ...Go on, then. Don't tell anyone.   #warm

? place:hydroponics_garden who:dlamini-lukas with:hart-ravi
A: Misting hour.
B: Best hour.
A: Smells like rain.
B: Smells like home. Somewhere's home.   #warm

? place:hydroponics_garden who:strand-erik with:oneill-imani
A: Did you paint me? A tiny me? On my bunk?
B: Couldn't say.
A: It had my running shoes.
B: Lovely shoes. Whoever painted them.   #funny

// ---- more of Deck 3 (moved from the common room: Deck 4 is batch 3's) ----
? place:lounge who:rina with:pell
A: Tiles?
B: On the warped board?
A: I win on any board. Sit down.
B: Fine. But I'm having the good chair.   #funny

? place:mess who:hart-ravi with:teague-theo|abara-rosa
A: Who drew me with a moustache?
B: Not me.
A: It's in your pen.
B: It's a very good moustache, though.   #funny

? place:lounge who:esposito-yara|bakshi-sol with:rina
A: Best of three?
B: Best of one. I don't need three.
A: Fair.
B: Your move. Honestly, take your time.   #funny

? place:lounge who:tran-chloe with:dlamini-lukas time:evening
A: Nearly ten.
B: Hm.
A: Lights out at ten.
B: I know. Two hundred and five times I know.   #funny

? place:infirmary who:grieve-thea with:tran-chloe|fonseca-arjun
A: There's a hat in the lost-property box.
B: There's a hat in mine too.
A: Your box?
B: My box. The real one.   #funny

// ---- the gym ----
? place:gym who:santos-zofia with:lindqvist-isak|moreau-signe
A: Two seconds. Two.
B: One and a half, after this morning.
A: You didn't.
B: I did. I'm coming for you. And Vance.   #funny

? place:gym who:larsen-hamid with:esposito-yara
A: Stretch first. Please.
B: I always stretch.
A: You stretch your arms. Legs too.
B: Fine. For you, legs.   #funny

? place:gym who:varga-tariq with:strand-erik
A: That race. I was ahead at the turn.
B: You were ahead at the start.
A: The turn's what counts.
B: The end's what counts, Tariq.   #funny

// ---- the booths queue ----
? place:booths who:vasquez-uma with:walsh-esme|grieve-thea|hart-ravi
A: How are your fish?
B: Fat, apparently. Yours?
A: My mum says the orange one's sulking.
B: Mine sulk too. It's a fish thing.   #funny

? place:booths who:eklund-leila with:keane-davi
A: Message for your gran?
B: For my gran. You?
A: For mine. Are they the same gran?
B: Can't be. Mine's never mentioned you.   #funny

? place:booths who:navarro-mateo|salo-saad|nakamura-bilal with:navarro-mateo|salo-saad|nakamura-bilal
A: Calling the Halcyon?
B: Calling my twin. Same thing, this week.
A: Tell the set I said hello.
B: You're the set. We're the set.   #funny

// ---- the store, and the mess again ----
? place:mess who:haddad-tamsin with:larsen-hamid
A: Practise after dinner? The chord?
B: The chord.
A: It's coming. Isn't it?
B: Something's coming. I'll bring the book.   #funny

? place:crew_store who:madsen-ivo with:esposito-yara
A: I've lost a sock. Blue. A flower on it.
B: Bought here last Tuesday. With a matching one.
A: How do you remember that?
B: I always remember. I never tell.   #funny

// ---- work, once ----
? place:mess who:walsh-esme with:varga-tariq act:work
A: These carrots are big.
B: They're the right size.
A: Ivo cut them.
B: Ah. They're Ivo-sized.   #funny

? place:mess who:dlamini-lukas with:haddad-tamsin act:work
A: Brennan's off. Galley runs itself.
B: You've been running for an hour.
A: It runs itself. Through me.
B: Sit down for one minute. Please.   #warm
